     <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>time tenses</prim=
ary><secondary>quick-tour version</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=
=3D"general-imported"><primary>tenses</primary><secondary>quick-tour versio=
n</secondary></indexterm> In English, every verb is tagged for the grammati=
cal category called tense: past, present, or future. The sentence</para>
     <example xml:id=3D"example-random-id-xIVa">
       <title>
